# 1.3.0's pages: the round in the panel's order (FX ENV LFO GLO / HOME SAVE ARP SEQ), the Noise page on it; the
# layers' levels on OCT- / OCT+ (a layer's page; held: on) and a part's strip (1.4.0: the Mix gone); OCT- + OCT+
# together, quickly: a true mute (the level kept), as PERFORM's white 1-6; the new knobs (Throws, Ghost, Notes, Hats; the Noise page's
# Level; the pings' Octave on the Pings page); a 1.3.0 ladder project (format 12) read
